== Test Tier 0
# Generated programs compiled by both paths, which must agree, run against an interpreter of the typed stream;
# --cross-check also runs them beside clang -O0's builds of the same programs as C, and links those that pass
# structs and unions by value with clang's functions, calls crossing both ways.
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-tier0 --cross-check
== Test integer builtin actions against Clang (part 4 of 4)
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-builtin-varargs-lower
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-builtin-misc-lower
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-builtin-float-lower
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-builtin-terminal-helpers
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-builtin-atomic-helpers
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-builtin-atomic-rmw-helpers
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-builtin-rounds-helper
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-builtin-math-helpers
== Test generated-code ISA selection and native records
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-x86-target-selection
== Test generated-code ISA policy
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-x86-target
